OL,3,GNEWSAScared rescue dog Rio becomes
OL,4,Acrime-fighting star
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rescue dog who was once so frightened
OL,7,Fshe backed away from anyone who
OL,8,Fapproached her is now helping uncover
OL,9,Forganised crime.
OL,11,FBelgian Malinois Rio had been passed
OL,12,Ffrom home to home as a puppy and with
OL,13,Flittle experience of the outside world
OL,14,Fwhen she arrived at Woodside Animal
OL,15,FWelfare Sanctuary near Plymouth, Devon,
OL,16,Fas a nervous and fearful dog.
OL,18,FRetired police dog trainer Shane Curnow
OL,19,Fwas asked to assess her behaviour in
OL,20,F2020 and after years of training, Rio
OL,21,Fdog is working in the National Crime
OL,22,FAgency-led Operation Machinize.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
